**dmtools-factory-bot[bot]** (2026-10-19):

# Thread 1 — `mergeReservedSlots: 0` kill switch is inert in gh-837 parallel mode

**Status: fixed.**

`reservationFor` now honors the explicit disable **before** the parallel override — `js/common/smRuleLayers.js`:

```js
function reservationFor(mergeSlots, validationMutexMax) {
    var slots = mergeSlots || 0;
    if (slots <= 0) return 0;   // explicit disable wins in EVERY mode
    var mutexMax = validationMutexMax || 1;
    return mutexMax > 1 ? mutexMax : slots;
}
```

TDD: the previously unpinned parallel case is now pinned in `UT-10` (`js/unit-tests/test_smTickLayers.js`) — `reservationFor(0, 3) === 0`, `reservationFor(0, 2) === 0`, and the string-kill-switch end-to-end `reservationFor(mergeReservedSlots({mergeReservedSlots: 'false'}), 3) === 0`. The test was written first and failed with `expected 0 but got 3` on the pre-fix tree.

